      "description": "Press Track is a simple, offline manager for printing presses and copy shops.\nRecord every print job — type, quantity, size, paper and finish, colour mode,\ndue date and advance — then move each job from the order book through the press\nto ready-for-pickup. No account, no sign-up, and no internet connection\nrequired. Everything is saved privately on your own device.\n\nAdd an order with the customer and the job spec, the date it's due, the price\nand any advance taken. Press Track works out the balance automatically and\nkeeps a clear status for every job.\n\nThe In Press screen shows exactly what's on the press now and what's queued\nnext, sorted by the date each job is due, so nothing slips. When a job is\nfinished, one tap marks it ready; the Ready screen lists everything waiting for\npickup along with the balance still to collect. When the customer arrives, mark\nit delivered.\n\nThe Reports screen turns your order book into clear numbers: total order value,\nhow much you've collected versus what's still owed, order and piece counts,\nrevenue by month and revenue by job type — so you can see your busiest work at\na glance.\n\nMade for printing presses, copy shops, sign makers and design studios who want\na fast, private, paper-free way to manage print orders.\n\nKey features:\n- Print orders with type, quantity, paper, colour and finish\n- Due date, price, advance and automatic balance\n- Order → In Press → Ready → Delivered status tracking\n- In Press queue and Ready-for-pickup board\n- Monthly and by-type revenue reports\n- 100% offline — your data never leaves the device\n- No login, no tracking",
